				940,
				3
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Consolidate shutdown logic formatting and correct Vine client call\n\nRefactor the shutdown sequence in `SaveApplicationState`, `ShutdownCocoonWithRetry`, and `ShutdownWithRecovery` to align with project style guidelines. Condense multi-line error mapping chains in `SaveApplicationState` and `ShutdownCocoonWithRetry` into single-line constructs for improved readability. Simplify the `dev_log!` macro invocation in `ShutdownWithRecovery` by removing unnecessary line breaks.\n\nCrucially, correct the invocation of the Vine client's shutdown marker in `ShutdownCocoonWithRetry`. Update the call from `MarkShutdown()` to `MarkShutdown::Fn()` to strictly adhere to the enforced PascalCase module path resolution pattern required by the Tauri command macros and the project's strict naming convention.\n\nThis ensures consistent code style across the runtime shutdown module and resolves the symbol resolution for the shutdown lifecycle hook.",
			"SHA": "cbc65d5f77fe835108f17fc251e6ecd6308c7c0e"
		},
